### Requisições prontas para testar a API manualmente.
### VS Code: instale a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) e clique em "Send Request"
### acima de cada bloco. JetBrains (WebStorm/IntelliJ): suporte nativo.
###
### Antes: bun run infra:up · bun run migrate · bun run dev  (ou bun run app:up para 3 réplicas)

@base = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = e07c7c76-6831-43ed-9419-42c6957a745f
@walletId = 01a122a2-9e42-7bb4-b2bc-fddab1a80d7f

### 1. Health (abertos, sem autenticação)
GET {{base}}/health/live

###
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### 2. Criar wallet — guarda o id em walletId para as próximas requisições
# @name wallet
POST {{base}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "1000.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

###

### 3. Criar a MESMA wallet de novo → 409 WALLET_ALREADY_EXISTS
POST {{base}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "1000.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 4. Consultar a wallet
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{walletId}}

### 5. BET de 25.00 → 201 PROCESSED, saldo 975.00
# @name bet
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-b:bet-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-b",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 6. Reenviar a MESMA BET → 200, mesmo corpo, "idempotentReplay": true (não debita de novo)
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-b:bet-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-b",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 7. Mesma key com valor DIFERENTE → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-b:bet-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-b",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "99.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 8. BET maior que o saldo → 422 REJECTED, failureCode INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-b:bet-too-big

{
  "providerId": "provider-b",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-too-big",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "999999.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 9. REFUND de uma BET que ainda não chegou → 202 PENDING_REFERENCE
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-b:refund-2

{
  "providerId": "provider-b",
  "externalTransactionId": "refund-2",
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "bet-2",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-2",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "REFUND",
  "money": { "amount": "10.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 10. A BET referenciada chega → 201. Em ~1s o worker aplica o REFUND (consulte o item 12)
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-b:bet-2

{
  "providerId": "provider-b",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-2",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-2",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "10.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 11. Transação pelo id interno (do item 5)
# GET {{base}}/wagering/transactions/{{bet.transactionId}}
GET {{base}}/wagering/transactions/01a122a5-6300-729d-8485-d6a19ec46c0f

### 12. Transação pelo id do provedor — o REFUND do item 9 deve estar PROCESSED
GET {{base}}/providers/provider-b/wagering/transactions/refund-2

### 13. Ledger (paginado; use o nextCursor da resposta em ?cursor=)
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=2

### 14. Reconciliação: saldo × ledger → "consistent": true
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation

### 15. Payload inválido → 400 (notação científica no valor)
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bad-1

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bad-1",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "1e3", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### 16. Métricas Prometheus
GET {{base}}/metrics
